d;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l019","ordinal":300265,"en":"If you count me as a human being,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l020","ordinal":300266,"en":"Lend me the strength of one horse."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l021","ordinal":300267,"en":"I am your captive held in bonds,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l022","ordinal":300268,"en":"I am a slave within your hands."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l023","ordinal":300269,"en":"I am yours to do with as you will,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l024","ordinal":300270,"en":"I am a man in your own hands."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l025","ordinal":300271,"en":"I am nothing but a captive slave,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l026","ordinal":300272,"en":"Black Khan's dark-eyed son.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l027","ordinal":300273,"en":"When he heard these tidings,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l028","ordinal":300274,"en":"Karagul, chief of the herdsmen—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l029","ordinal":300275,"en":"There stood the sly wretch,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l030","ordinal":300276,"en":"The forceful Karagul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l031","ordinal":300277,"en":"Who from his khan, brave Kyyaz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l032","ordinal":300278,"en":"Had taken his example."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l033","ordinal":300279,"en":"Exceedingly wrathful Karagul"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l034","ordinal":300280,"en":"Grew furious and made ready;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l035","ordinal":300281,"en":"The accursed madman"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l036","ordinal":300282,"en":"Confronted him in a rage:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l037","ordinal":300283,"en":"“Look how this rabid, cunning slave"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l038","ordinal":300284,"en":"Has run mad!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l039","ordinal":300285,"en":"His armor once weighed eighty-four,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l040","ordinal":300286,"en":"Wherever he struck, red fire flared."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l001","ordinal":300287,"en":"While the doomed man still had strength,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l002","ordinal":300288,"en":"He was a mass of glowing embers,"}]
